{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 27, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^2\n  ucas: parity it\nparity of it:\n  even: f(-x) = f(x)\n  proved symbolically (parity rules: x is odd; sums keep a common parity, products multiply it; sin/tan/atan preserve it, cos/abs make it even)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 27, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "is x squared even?", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x) = x^2", "parity it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "parity", "even": "f(-x) = f(x)", "proved_symbolically_parity_rules": "x is odd; sums keep a common parity, products multiply it; sin/tan/atan preserve it, cos/abs make it even)", "headline": "parity of it:"}]}, "notes": [{"kind": "assumed", "text": "\"even\": an even function, f(-x) = f(x) (args.assume.question)"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^2\n  ucas: parity it\nparity of it:\n  even: f(-x) = f(x)\n  proved symbolically (parity rules: x is odd; sums keep a common parity, products multiply it; sin/tan/atan preserve it, cos/abs make it even)\n"}, "isError": false}}
